cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Simulation code for "Analytically Controlled Point-Gap Topology from
  Lindblad to Markov Dynamics"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software (this record) and
  the accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aishwarya
    family-names: Vishwakarma
