repository-code: 'https://github.com/vishwaka-2419/lhn-point-gap-topology'
abstract: >-
  Python code reproducing the figures and numerical results of a study of
  point-gap topology in a time-independent Lindblad Hatano-Nelson chain and
  its analytically controlled reduction to a classical Markov generator.
keywords:
  - open quantum systems
  - Lindblad dynamics
  - non-Hermitian topology
  - point-gap winding
  - Markov processes
